### API CALL FOR ADD EMPLOYEE
post http://127.0.0.1:8000/emp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"raju",
    "email":"raju@gmail.com",
    "department":"developer",
    "designation":" junior developer"
}


### API CALL FOR LIST EMPLOYEE
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/emp


### API CALL FOR UPDATE EMPLOYEE
patch http://127.0.0.1:8000/emp/details/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "department":"frontend"

}

### API CALL FOR RETRIEVE EMPLOYEE
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/emp/details/1

### API CALL FOR DELETE EMPLOYEE
delete http://127.0.0.1:8000/emp/details/2


### API CALL FOR  TASK CREATE
post http://127.0.0.1:8000/task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}

{
    "title":"gym website",
    "description":"good",
    "assigned_to":4,
    "priority":"High",
    "due_date":"2026-11-30"
}


### API CALL FOR LIST TASK
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/task
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}


### API CALL FOR RETRIVE TASK
get  http://127.0.0.1:8000/task/details/2
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}


### API CALL FOR UPDATE TASK
patch http://127.0.0.1:8000/task/details/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}

{
    "status":"Completed",
    "due_date":"2026-11-26"
}

### API CALL FOR  DELETE TASK
delete http://127.0.0.1:8000/task/details/2
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}




### API CALL FOR TOKEN CREATION
post http://127.0.0.1:8000/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"shahil",
    "password":"shahil"
}

