### API CALL FOR SEARCH STATUS 
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/task?status=Completed
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}


### API CALL FOR STATUS PENDING
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/task?status=Pending
Authorization: Token {{shahil}}



### API CALL FOR PARTICULAR EMPLOYEE PENDING
get http://127.0.0.1:8000/pending/3
